We recently visited Settebello Italian Wood-Fired Pizza, and it was such a delightful experience! We had a couple of their signature pizzas and the gnocchi in pesto sauce — every bite was full of flavour. The pizzas were beautifully wood-fired, light yet filling, with a perfect crust that didn’t feel heavy at all. The gnocchi pesto was creamy, aromatic, and cooked to perfection. The ambience was warm and welcoming, and the service was genuinely lovely. Highly recommend this spot for anyone craving authentic Italian with great vibes.

