We recently dined at Narmthong Thai Restaurant and had a great experience. We ordered Thai red curry, fried tofu with peanut sauce, spring rolls, and another Thai curry. The food was full of authentic flavors—especially the red curry, which was rich and aromatic. The tofu was perfectly crispy and paired so well with the creamy peanut sauce. While the prices were a bit on the higher side, the taste and quality made it worthwhile. A solid spot for Thai food lovers!

